The now-orphaned simplicial-interval-localization helper is retained with an unreachable import flag. Remove this flag when a future independent split reaches it again. Its statement and proof are unchanged.

All hypotheses and conclusions, sources, searches, blueprint ancestry, and Lean records are preserved. No item proof, Lean file or pipeline tool changed. Backups are beside all changed files as .maint-NK-derived-exponential-1792219779.bak. Both authoritative live records and the newtargets snapshot require this repair so DAG synchronization cannot restore the bad edges.

Exact retained NK overlay closure after repair: 226 nodes, zero cycles, zero self loops, zero missing dependencies. Full baseline DAG findings elsewhere remain separate. Keep the item sandbox, citations, searches and report; rerun the normal no-push delivery, then continue the normal reader/delivery workflow.
